Package: nft-firewall-v2
Version: 2.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nftables, wireguard-tools, systemd
Maintainer: NFT Firewall V2 contributors
Description: Declarative nftables and WireGuard firewall controller
 Strict typed policy, scoped atomic nftables transactions, SQLite state,
 durable safe apply, local Unix sockets, and a read-only dashboard.
